## Quick Reference: CAP Decision Tree

```
Designing a distributed system?
│
├── Does this feature involve money, bookings, or inventory?
│   └── YES → Strong Consistency (CP)
│       └── PostgreSQL, Spanner, DynamoDB strong mode, 2PC
│
├── Do users need to see their own writes immediately?
│   └── YES → Read-your-own-writes consistency
│       └── Session-aware routing, write-then-read from leader
│
├── Must related events appear in order? (chat, comments)
│   └── YES → Causal Consistency
│       └── MongoDB causal sessions, vector clocks
│
└── Is it browsing, feeds, search, or content display?
    └── YES → Eventual Consistency (AP)
        └── Cassandra, Redis, async replicas, CDC
```

